              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Assay for serum canine follicle-stimulating hormone (FSH) concentration—elevated with degeneration and hypoplasia; normal in azoospermic dogs experiencing retrograde ejaculation or bilateral epididymal blockage. Currently commercially unavailable.",
